#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Twilight OS Setup Assistant (GUI Installer)
Native Qt6 graphical installer for Twilight OS.

This installer provides a complete guided installation experience:
  1. Welcome + System Info
  2. Locale & Timezone
  3. Disk / Partitioning
  4. User Account Setup
  5. Software Suite Selection (50 curated apps)
  6. GPU Drivers & Extras
  7. Review & Install

The user's choices are written to a twilight-install.conf file and passed
to a post-install script that applies them on the target system.
"""

